 child and an ancestral mystery. Using vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_DD9JrTipmQQ7kNvwHHBsY-&_nc_oc=Adp9KcdLm-2g2LZw9PRpUYbru_2EHiViISAUS0YjfSlSOMitSYBS43JmJXb--yTjDzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC4qbAJUV7pQPLE9zQnPpZRB0BwLYZw-S2beHyx7Zhezw&oe=6A6776C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P2LM_vSeAC8Q7kNvwFUqxc-&_nc_oc=AdraX9iUjKlcWVH_qthW52g8bm-wfFOXhu1gZbGDgTYjMac3RZdcciiZlGdQd5BuJsw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCqqIInlHPx9JCQT8NYx-hzAV4fuPbgbu4shPEcJEe83A&oe=6A674BE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-4VaLDp6dcYQ7kNvwGp5zFy&_nc_oc=AdojhZP4H2m0hXxGFlA3Lk-AHWXzG39iXcw0n43phL7sVzMjXU-C5s5_iCpgS8iqMHU&_nc_zt=3